      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Because the City is now facing unprecedented traffic volumes and a record number of private and public construction programs, it is important that all agencies and departments cooperate to minimize traffic disruptions. Where in the past, lane closings may have had little effect on the City's overall traffic flow, they now represent serious threats to the traffic system.",
